{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","created_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2e79f6cbc445267e043fc325c57984bccf8c193287c97134b3e4b9c18052ced9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"akashgit/remote-factory@4262d361ebbf snapshot cd2e332d94e06242","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3db687d849895d8e823b13ef65eccb249d0e9ca8edd56122391969433390c973","slc_7805798f088f9327068f4ae6058fae73ff3967d2f8d636407ecdfd7d91f85561"],"source_ids":["src_281df9e0d30a5dfa88293103989dd807"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors install dev deps with `uv sync --all-groups`, run `pytest -v`, lint with `ruff check .`, and type-check with `mypy factory/`; a contributing guide covers dev setup, code style, testing, and PR workflow.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","created_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3576d03ca23a9ca7bdc0abee2d0a7cb17fa1b93cdb689155e55da1ac03ed52d5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"akashgit/remote-factory@4262d361ebbf snapshot cd2e332d94e06242","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_24b6dcc9319a5f5b2c1bb18746ead8ab2473e8d7cddf8ae1adfa425517d2de5e","slc_adbffa8c479bfaaaa397c8a42740a87b285d8b50c632819ce5b8a35066ad0ae7","slc_f200ca9fc1d74e0fd080a55381c74027a95f6e776087f1729b0232675d4b433f","slc_fbcfe09423aab625ceea9b90ec826e1937e9172b4fbcc9a0c6ffaf1b4e263c31"],"source_ids":["src_281df9e0d30a5dfa88293103989dd807"],"text":"The system is described as four layers: a Python CLI, a workflow graph engine of Pydantic DAGs with typed nodes (AgentNode, FnNode, GateNode, ForkNode, JoinNode), a CEO orchestrator agent, and specialist Claude Code subprocess agents.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","created_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_48ba8b306d91ee5b2d38650cd784466fc0e617e55754d4961b0e87a5912f7321","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"akashgit/remote-factory@4262d361ebbf snapshot cd2e332d94e06242","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_68710b7cd696bb323947374160c39d87e752227109af8d4794a6e0c94b441feb","slc_7c19f2abaf74aca88c32b07aba5b9b299e933996113462042dda3672cff93fa5","slc_f6bc631b7397984227dd8d346e947076eae127851a78886d0706bd9ca2e419fa"],"source_ids":["src_281df9e0d30a5dfa88293103989dd807"],"text":"Shipped workflows include frontend-design, parallel-improve, deep-research, design-v2, deep-qa, and study, plus community-contributed benchmark workflows (swebench, featurebench, legacybench, devopsgym, terminalbench, and others) following a study→solver→gate→merge pattern.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","created_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4ac2a362fa3af9474cb702bd6f65d30d415aa5000881f91e77d93cd0867669a2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"akashgit/remote-factory@4262d361ebbf snapshot cd2e332d94e06242","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_003cd4b37fbc62fc22307d560afb651d0ff6b1f6a18cbd6e6fdf031e3d535d3c","slc_29db0d4d1c59d20c144415bec800ae7d000bc4db14e48a53b3dc55a6b7f2ca97","slc_2b1e5eb240a763fabf82330b247889cb445a1e644f4ea2da9544e22e8405dd53","slc_4375e25e5d9fd8e3e768007b57401c636f9084296fdc78d87eaa19c2d6f174ff","slc_d4eb86437d06f30afaae48860fae70f1eb313a60b41181f886bd7830e93b9dc4","slc_d6ef19d269ef8b09f0389cbef6d8169ac034692d6ec19f08e72dd76999900eee"],"source_ids":["src_281df9e0d30a5dfa88293103989dd807"],"text":"The primary CLI is `factory ceo <path> --mode <mode>` with modes including design, design-v2, create, meta, and outer-loop (run headless), plus `--focus` to target a backlog item, GitHub issue, or topic.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","created_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_564419e94a8ee8d48902fe6a4f50b05b0c12f52b2c4116c10130e8e60cad44a8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"akashgit/remote-factory@4262d361ebbf snapshot cd2e332d94e06242","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_24b6dcc9319a5f5b2c1bb18746ead8ab2473e8d7cddf8ae1adfa425517d2de5e","slc_6e3ff299aa9b8096d2c7a79150a4bb256f03b39713b8340f44637b8892b6e347","slc_f200ca9fc1d74e0fd080a55381c74027a95f6e776087f1729b0232675d4b433f"],"source_ids":["src_281df9e0d30a5dfa88293103989dd807","src_d5fbd197ca925c9898f5edc039e499bb"],"text":"The CEO agent detects project state, reads SKILL.md playbooks, spawns specialist agents via `factory agent <role>`, and makes keep/revert decisions based on eval scores.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","created_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_612402e8c8d146e9c5a8673d4b6a7d2d8a0970ba9f32ee1044ed1d4279e145ae","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"akashgit/remote-factory@4262d361ebbf snapshot cd2e332d94e06242","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_47f83b2e82ed072f6dafa9712262e284a1dfbb20ab864ead63452e86891a3198"],"source_ids":["src_281df9e0d30a5dfa88293103989dd807"],"text":"An outer loop evolves workflow DAGs against benchmarks via MAP-Elites: it mutates workflow structure, evaluates candidates on a real benchmark instance, and selects for higher test pass rates.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","created_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6eccd6a991efc6cc435e86bcab9e27965b6d8e6f1a1bb1ff13f63df4623b49e6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"akashgit/remote-factory@4262d361ebbf snapshot cd2e332d94e06242","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2b4a10117fc240f6a460135826f025c06d5e846a2cc195fcbc22a9e77cd65824","slc_5ee794a99f19550ed1d22ebb4bf9016d78b3f98c82f48de5b75709539efea91c","slc_aacf5feab6701f79725a92d24cd132969f661c644f7ed298760481b314fc9019","slc_ce4b9cd8393569967178acdbf1830a145d2e2d5c512bf4433ae1851ebdff7023","slc_edc6c822cd8f48b0efe7266b90b38d92098cd214ed7aa88887ac56be468aa37a"],"source_ids":["src_11287036d0d0533c8468cfa59cedd381"],"text":"ACE self-improvement derives playbook bullets from real experiment outcomes, tracks helpful/harmful counters per bullet, prunes negative-net-score rules, caps playbook size, and injects evolved playbooks into agent prompts at spawn time.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","created_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_769193f44278cef171e83166d0cc0fc6c4ed8a29d0241e461ad90c8e978efafb","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"akashgit/remote-factory@4262d361ebbf snapshot cd2e332d94e06242","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_07311693ba96d8e313824fadb2341666c4430a66264d31c017c4f30fae9f4912","slc_6a665fe5c4723a3de8ba0e5bb6f423ad4c86c428c57abd426cfc53c0eff366ab","slc_b0acaec87c9c0ac5310d6da12b0bc489b8e4723438dc6fc6ae28f1f86ef3f457","slc_fc6825f70ed1a5859c42bb144123c1515ba8e33a47fcc4907914443fa297c8e3"],"source_ids":["src_281df9e0d30a5dfa88293103989dd807"],"text":"Workflow graphs are exported to SKILL.md prose playbooks through a verified pipeline (templatize, review agent, guard, split) producing SKILL.md plus SKILL.annotations.yaml, with a CI regression test guarding drift between definitions and exported skills.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","created_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_962c453b48dd39bec12c357cb717f7fc64d1457675cb62a7fd44ea1f520f002d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"akashgit/remote-factory@4262d361ebbf snapshot cd2e332d94e06242","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_34958f3ab208a8d85b7da94a4f0c7caa60265c7b4cff64dbe25ce01695a7aef4","slc_45eb10796dbad8592ef9d285415142f4087c6d7618ec590b9b0f1793fb05ea5c","slc_865083652d954306516ea3e15e5b227c5fc3a64dfe679a0fb5f263bf3047cdc7"],"source_ids":["src_d5fbd197ca925c9898f5edc039e499bb"],"text":"Agent prompts resolve through a three-tier lookup — project-specific override, user-global override, then the factory default — and a plugin system via the `factory.plugins` entry-point group can extend modes, commands, and agent roles with builtins winning collisions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","created_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9f09e96cd9af30f094c300cef6398c3c551203087faf24c716f6ef1d43d46a95","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"akashgit/remote-factory@4262d361ebbf snapshot cd2e332d94e06242","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e5e0dba426f9436c86d2f35353b899c34c1e762e47d9c096c1988bdac39629ea","slc_f116977c06a1f3ae85739b9001622514dfe7bab0a879608a47cc466a2cc1f445"],"source_ids":["src_281df9e0d30a5dfa88293103989dd807"],"text":"Design-v2 replaces hardcoded researchers and a single strategist with three Director agents that dynamically size N (3-7) research directions, M (2-5) strategy perspectives, and K (2-5) QA testers, following parallel generation, synthesis, then gating.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:32:34Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d90899c765764d65b9bcb3ba74c68954"}
